WEBVTT

00:01.020 --> 00:05.950
Sorry, but I'm still not interested

00:05.950 --> 00:09.310
in your path or your growth.

00:18.360 --> 00:22.190
That was my biggest attack...

00:24.710 --> 00:28.080
Is he really that far away from me?

00:29.390 --> 00:33.160
What are you thinking?
What are you aiming for?

00:33.160 --> 00:35.280
Katsuki Bakugo.

00:36.130 --> 00:40.330
If there's just one thing I'm
interested in about you...

00:41.160 --> 00:46.110
it's that you're the person closest
to Izuku Midoriya right now...

00:47.300 --> 00:51.380
In that case, he'll definitely
come back here.

00:52.200 --> 00:54.470
Izuku Midoriya...

00:55.830 --> 00:58.360
and One For All...

02:31.420 --> 02:32.450
Damn it!

02:32.760 --> 02:34.590
Mandalay, Midoriya's not here yet?

02:34.890 --> 02:35.910
I can't get a hold of him!

02:35.910 --> 02:37.460
You could earlier!

02:37.460 --> 02:39.290
Even if I weren't inside the barrier,

02:39.290 --> 02:41.500
I can't connect well when there's
a disturbance in the radio waves.

02:41.500 --> 02:43.930
All I've been getting is
static for a while now.

02:44.420 --> 02:46.230
Bakugo...

02:46.540 --> 02:49.530
Jeanist! Mirko! Edge Shot!

02:49.530 --> 02:51.320
Please protect Bakugo!

02:51.320 --> 02:52.180
Damn it...

02:52.180 --> 02:57.330
He's going to graduate from U.A.
and aim to be the number one hero!

03:03.390 --> 03:06.280
Our school...

03:08.560 --> 03:09.820
Hado...

03:10.760 --> 03:14.020
I wanted to have a graduation ceremony...

03:14.940 --> 03:16.210
Sounds good.

03:16.840 --> 03:18.140
You came, too?

03:18.140 --> 03:21.040
Those were my instructions.

03:21.040 --> 03:22.930
After the battle's over,

03:22.930 --> 03:26.150
let's have Principal Nezu put on
a graduation ceremony for us!

03:26.610 --> 03:27.860
Yeah.

03:28.660 --> 03:30.110
Can we win?

03:30.740 --> 03:36.190
Let's at least protect everyone
until Midoriya gets here.

03:37.600 --> 03:40.240
With the power of the three of us!

03:41.030 --> 03:45.030
Light Fades to Rain

03:47.370 --> 03:52.210
Izuku Midoriya was supposed
to be here. Right?

03:52.650 --> 03:56.230
Then he should be back here before long.

03:57.060 --> 04:00.540
I guess it was good that
my Quirks were erased.

04:06.260 --> 04:09.590
Then you won't become dust,
and a corpse will remain.

04:10.200 --> 04:13.410
He was already so angry
when I just skewered you.

04:14.450 --> 04:18.060
Looks like you'll be a
great present for him...

04:19.880 --> 04:23.600
You admired the victorious
All Might, right?

04:24.350 --> 04:27.650
You need to face reality, Katsuki Bakugo.

04:28.090 --> 04:30.080
No matter how far you try to go,

04:30.410 --> 04:33.600
you're just goldfish poop
next to All For One.

04:35.300 --> 04:37.050
Nejire...

04:37.050 --> 04:38.240
Pike!

04:48.010 --> 04:49.850
Vast Hybrid...

04:50.410 --> 04:55.390
Octopus Mirage + Scorpius Toxin!

04:58.830 --> 04:59.900
Poison...

05:05.950 --> 05:08.000
Is that all you've got?

05:09.130 --> 05:12.030
My body will keep adapting.

05:12.320 --> 05:14.470
If you keep dribbling in slowly from afar...

05:15.120 --> 05:17.180
then you won't...

05:18.420 --> 05:20.470
...be able to defeat me!

05:29.430 --> 05:30.590
Jeanist!

05:35.520 --> 05:36.640
All right.

05:38.350 --> 05:40.990
I've seen you before.

05:41.560 --> 05:43.030
You were at Jaku.

05:44.340 --> 05:46.240
Your face is a joke.

05:46.550 --> 05:50.490
I'm Lemillion. I'm the hero
acting as messenger and guard.

05:50.890 --> 05:54.090
In order to intercept any villains
other than you who show up

05:54.090 --> 05:57.620
and make sure information
is circulated smoothly,

05:57.620 --> 06:00.700
they needed someone who could move fast.

06:00.700 --> 06:04.920
But I can't just stand
here and watch quietly.

06:05.550 --> 06:07.460
Why are you destroying?

06:07.750 --> 06:11.790
Because the current organizational
structure has failed.

06:13.540 --> 06:14.760
Here!

06:15.240 --> 06:17.100
I see.

06:17.540 --> 06:20.180
You didn't have any friends.

06:22.360 --> 06:23.240
Huh?

06:23.890 --> 06:27.660
Even if I can get close to him, I don't
have anything that'll hurt him.

06:27.660 --> 06:32.600
So I'll bring Hado's energy
right next to him!

06:33.090 --> 06:35.490
If you had friends,

06:35.490 --> 06:37.380
you would've understood...

06:40.070 --> 06:43.510
That there are things you shouldn't destroy!

06:46.800 --> 06:52.100
Until Midoriya gets here, I can't
let Shigaraki do anything!

06:55.050 --> 06:57.600
Dynamight, let me see your right arm.

06:57.600 --> 06:58.470
I'll sew you up.

06:58.840 --> 07:01.350
We still need your firepower. Hurry--

07:11.930 --> 07:13.450
Let me see your arm.

07:13.450 --> 07:15.790
We'll take care of the rest somehow.

07:16.330 --> 07:19.610
Shigaraki is already on
a whole other level.

07:19.610 --> 07:24.750
You were stationed here because
you fought him before.

07:26.080 --> 07:31.210
But there's no room to use
that experience anymore.

07:32.080 --> 07:33.620
You did a good job.

07:33.620 --> 07:35.120
You've done enough.

07:36.420 --> 07:38.590
Right...

07:44.560 --> 07:47.190
Finger... feint...

07:52.270 --> 07:53.350
Right...

07:53.870 --> 07:57.250
Timing... wraparound...

07:58.340 --> 07:59.520
back...

08:02.430 --> 08:05.490
He's still...

08:08.670 --> 08:11.980
Even so, he's still...!

08:15.550 --> 08:17.930
Mirio Togata

08:19.560 --> 08:21.930
Tamaki Amajiki

08:24.990 --> 08:27.020
If you had friends,

08:27.020 --> 08:29.150
you wouldn't be doing this, right?

08:29.550 --> 08:31.380
You'd want to protect them.

08:31.380 --> 08:33.690
You wouldn't destroy things!

08:41.720 --> 08:43.170
Friends...

08:43.970 --> 08:48.430
I told Mikkun and Tomo we
should play together.

08:48.430 --> 08:51.870
And we played heroes,
and it was really fun.

08:52.780 --> 08:54.070
I do have friends...

08:56.260 --> 09:00.800
Mikkun and Tomo said I was nice!

09:00.800 --> 09:03.280
Mon wanted to take walks with me!

09:03.670 --> 09:07.240
I do too have friends!

09:13.100 --> 09:15.030
S-Sorry.

09:17.900 --> 09:19.670
What was that just now?

09:19.670 --> 09:22.100
Did I bring up a sensitive topic?

09:22.100 --> 09:23.420
Better not do that again.

09:23.420 --> 09:24.530
More importantly...

09:25.010 --> 09:29.420
Compared to the newer tentacles,
his main body is really hard!

09:29.420 --> 09:33.880
Even using Hado's power, I
couldn't scratch the surface!

09:33.880 --> 09:35.550
This is really bad!

09:38.360 --> 09:40.050
I'm splitting apart...

09:40.510 --> 09:42.410
My body was complete!

09:42.970 --> 09:46.910
Tomura Shigaraki should have been
completely integrated with me!

09:48.170 --> 09:52.350
But then, why was there still a
part that hadn't fully fused?

09:53.920 --> 09:57.090
Something that was neither
Tomura nor All For One...

10:00.450 --> 10:01.990
Shimura.

10:07.230 --> 10:09.580
It'll be a pain if this gets dragged out.

10:23.090 --> 10:24.150
Wait!

10:25.310 --> 10:28.180
There's no reason for me to keep you
company while you stall for time.

10:28.730 --> 10:32.060
I thought I could make you
falter at least a little.

10:33.840 --> 10:36.830
Hado and Tamaki, you two
make the first move.

10:36.830 --> 10:40.790
In that opening, I'll make my first
appearance and pull Bakugo away.

10:40.790 --> 10:41.870
After that,

10:41.870 --> 10:45.500
I'll stall for time since I can touch
the main body without taking damage.

10:46.180 --> 10:50.860
But if I can't deal any damage, I
won't be able to buy any time.

10:51.350 --> 10:52.340
That's why...

10:53.160 --> 10:56.800
I'll buy YOU time, Tamaki!

11:03.130 --> 11:07.400
Come on! Just you try and
get me, evil incarnate!

11:07.920 --> 11:09.380
Don't push yourself.

11:09.380 --> 11:12.230
I got a good hit in.

11:12.570 --> 11:15.590
You're barely staying
conscious, aren't you?

11:17.120 --> 11:19.690
Take that!

11:22.440 --> 11:25.480
This place was created to defeat you--

11:25.480 --> 11:27.230
the Coffin in the Sky!

11:28.440 --> 11:30.580
It looks like you people

11:30.930 --> 11:33.200
made your own coffins...

11:34.250 --> 11:36.630
for you to lie in yourselves...

11:47.970 --> 11:52.020
Hey, hey, your Quirk lets you
stretch out your fingers, right?

11:49.020 --> 11:52.020
Middle School

11:52.020 --> 11:53.800
When do you use it?

11:53.800 --> 11:56.500
If your fingers are stretched out,
isn't it hard to type on your phone?

11:56.500 --> 11:57.660
How strange.

11:57.660 --> 11:59.230
She's crazy, huh?

11:59.230 --> 12:00.900
Crazier than crazy.

11:59.680 --> 12:02.190
Keiko, with your brush Quirk,

12:02.190 --> 12:06.110
if you clean the tub or polish shoes, is
your arm dirty when you turn it back?

12:06.110 --> 12:09.340
You have to clean it again,
right? How strange...

12:09.600 --> 12:11.810
Maki, your Quirk lets you grow your hair!

12:11.810 --> 12:13.250
Isn't it hard to take care of it?

12:13.250 --> 12:17.330
When you grow up, will you open a wig
shop? Or be a ghost in a haunted house?

12:17.660 --> 12:20.040
I wonder... How strange...

12:20.520 --> 12:22.050
Hey you.

12:22.050 --> 12:23.880
Yes? What is it?

12:24.230 --> 12:26.520
Just because you have a Quirk
that can do anything,

12:26.930 --> 12:30.190
you're looking down on the
rest of us, aren't you?

12:30.560 --> 12:32.700
You're mean.

12:32.700 --> 12:34.390
No one wants to hear you talk.

12:36.270 --> 12:39.040
The more I wanted to know
about someone else,

12:40.020 --> 12:42.100
the more they all kept their distance.

12:42.790 --> 12:44.020
But you know...

12:44.790 --> 12:45.810
H...

12:48.980 --> 12:51.340
He... Heroes...

12:55.380 --> 12:57.190
Which one do you like?

13:07.800 --> 13:10.180
Hey, hey! Why are you hiding your face?

13:10.180 --> 13:11.880
Isn't it hard if you can't
see where you're going?

13:11.880 --> 13:13.550
Th-That's...

13:13.550 --> 13:15.570
Why are you raising your thumb?

13:15.570 --> 13:17.340
I-It's what Mirio--

13:17.340 --> 13:19.590
Why is your body trembling?

13:17.350 --> 13:23.320
How strange~

13:19.590 --> 13:20.970
How strange.

13:20.970 --> 13:22.960
She keeps coming at me...

13:24.170 --> 13:27.820
But you know, it's because
you asked me that...

13:29.450 --> 13:33.790
Because I was able to get
to know you two here...

13:37.520 --> 13:40.700
That I was able to become even stronger.

13:51.600 --> 13:53.880
The true value of Vast Hybrid...

13:54.250 --> 13:56.360
It takes time to activate,

13:57.210 --> 14:01.690
but Togata and I know you, Tamaki Amajiki.

14:02.980 --> 14:07.110
Zebra Tarantula + Dragonfruit + Spider Crab

14:07.110 --> 14:11.080
+ Sika Deer + Japanese Chestnut
+ American Alligator...

14:15.580 --> 14:18.320
...plus Nejire Hado's energy!

14:18.720 --> 14:22.280
The more he eats, the more
possibilities he has.

14:22.780 --> 14:26.290
If there's one thing that
could work on Shigaraki...

14:26.690 --> 14:29.330
it's you, with your Quirk with no limits!

14:30.450 --> 14:32.530
Have confidence in yourself, Tamaki.

14:33.920 --> 14:36.840
That's right, it's you...

14:37.230 --> 14:38.800
Suneater!

14:40.600 --> 14:45.440
If I fail, then everyone here will
be killed, and it'll all be over.

14:46.220 --> 14:48.410
You should be proud, Tamaki!

14:48.760 --> 14:51.040
You're so cool!

14:49.700 --> 14:51.030
Wow!
Wow!

14:51.740 --> 14:57.660
I know that you really have amazing power.

14:59.150 --> 15:01.190
The dazzling words of light...

15:02.070 --> 15:04.720
The treasures others have given to me...

15:06.070 --> 15:07.640
Up until now...

15:09.080 --> 15:10.820
...I haven't been able
to accept them fully.

15:11.940 --> 15:14.970
Because I would've been crushed
by the weight of the treasures.

15:16.270 --> 15:19.430
Because it was easier to
be self-deprecating.

15:21.990 --> 15:24.360
Thanks, everyone.

15:25.140 --> 15:29.570
Now, that weight is making me stronger.

15:31.130 --> 15:32.370
Petty tricks!

15:33.160 --> 15:34.900
Vast Hybrid...

15:36.340 --> 15:38.070
Plasma Cannon!

15:45.430 --> 15:47.170
Get out of here!

15:48.030 --> 15:52.040
Can you get it through your
thick heads already?!

16:29.840 --> 16:31.100
Why...

16:32.000 --> 16:34.220
Think about it!

16:34.220 --> 16:38.980
Would Golden Age All Might have
died from something like this?

16:39.510 --> 16:42.630
Just think about it!

16:57.130 --> 16:59.310
Take care of the others.

16:59.310 --> 17:00.240
Baku--

17:08.020 --> 17:11.840
I have to win... right, Izuku?

17:11.840 --> 17:13.810
No, don't go!

17:24.590 --> 17:25.470
Right...

17:39.280 --> 17:41.190
He saw it and dodged?

17:47.170 --> 17:48.960
Quirk: Explosion.

17:49.470 --> 17:52.790
He uses a nitroglycerin-like substance
secreted on the palms of his hands

17:52.790 --> 17:54.060
to create explosions.

17:54.530 --> 18:01.180
The new move he invented, Cluster, had a
side effect even he didn't know about.

18:02.270 --> 18:06.060
This move, which had him storing
sweat and releasing it in balls,

18:06.060 --> 18:09.540
was extremely hard on the
sweat glands on his palms.

18:10.810 --> 18:14.880
As he focused on victory and continued
to store up balls of sweat,

18:14.880 --> 18:19.390
the balls sought a different exit and
leaked out from his whole body.

18:20.390 --> 18:22.460
The explosion that came from his whole body

18:22.460 --> 18:25.070
produced even more speed.

18:26.380 --> 18:28.300
My whole body hurts.

18:29.910 --> 18:31.840
Fighting while in pain,

18:32.630 --> 18:34.850
trying to spot the enemy's tells...

18:35.510 --> 18:39.540
You already went through
all this, didn't you?

18:42.130 --> 18:44.230
Hey, Izuku...

18:45.760 --> 18:50.110
Can I still catch up to you?

18:51.750 --> 18:54.060
Why is he pissing me off?

18:54.060 --> 18:56.890
Even though he's an extra who
doesn't have One For All...

18:58.140 --> 19:02.430
He should be the same as
that undersized beetle...

19:03.820 --> 19:07.840
Why am I getting flustered...?

19:12.930 --> 19:15.050
I'll destroy you!

19:32.830 --> 19:35.620
Oh, that's right...

19:38.030 --> 19:40.940
Well... um...

19:42.400 --> 19:44.670
When we first met,

19:45.460 --> 19:48.720
I guess I was kind of a brat.

19:49.340 --> 19:53.310
So I didn't get a chance to say this...

20:03.550 --> 20:04.550
I...

20:08.180 --> 20:10.600
wanted your autograph...

20:41.260 --> 20:43.470
According to reports from
volunteer weather watchers,

20:43.470 --> 20:48.560
Local Weather Bulletin
Sudden change in temperature around the Kanto, Chubu, and Kansai regions

20:43.870 --> 20:48.560
the Kanto, Chubu, and Kansai regions,
which started the day with clear skies

20:48.560 --> 20:53.630
had a sudden rise in temperature that is
causing uncertain weather conditions.

20:54.210 --> 20:56.180
Is it going to rain?

20:57.470 --> 21:01.320
That kid hates rain...

21:03.370 --> 21:07.530
You just retraced the fight from before...

21:08.360 --> 21:10.780
Why did you think you could win?

21:11.640 --> 21:14.100
We came prepared.

21:14.100 --> 21:16.920
The demon lord's body was complete.

21:17.930 --> 21:19.690
Do you get it now?

21:20.210 --> 21:21.450
From now on...

21:22.770 --> 21:25.290
...it'll be OUR story.

21:25.880 --> 21:29.420
Hang in there! I'll treat
it right away, Dyna--

21:35.180 --> 21:37.060
His heart...

23:19.960 --> 23:21.960
Preview

23:21.090 --> 23:22.410
Here's the preview!

23:23.250 --> 23:26.810
Kacchan's body has been pierced
through by Shigaraki.

23:27.520 --> 23:30.310
In addition, Dabi and All For One rally

23:30.310 --> 23:33.590
and the battle suddenly turns
in favor of the villains.

23:34.220 --> 23:36.430
Hurry, Izuku Midoriya.

23:36.430 --> 23:38.540
In order to bring together hope!

23:39.540 --> 23:42.270
Next time, "Those Who Defend,
Those Who Violate."

23:43.270 --> 23:46.490
The heroes won't lose. They can't lose!

23:45.940 --> 23:49.940
Next time: Those Who Defend, Those Who Violate

23:46.810 --> 23:48.380
Go beyond!

23:48.380 --> 23:49.670
Plus Ultra!
